    "text": "Two plane mirrors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are at right angle to each other shown. A point source <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is placed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math> meter away from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> respectively. The shortest distance between the images thus formed is : (Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math>)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/34d8d307-7505-4f96-b61c-cc9868c885fa-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 254px;\" />",
